# NASA Open APIs key used for DONKI space-weather requests.
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle, so this value is
# PUBLIC to anyone who loads the app. It is not a secret.
# DEMO_KEY works without sign-up but is heavily rate-limited.
# Get a free personal key at https://api.nasa.gov/ and put it in .env.local
# (which is git-ignored). Never commit a personal key.
VITE_NASA_API_KEY=DEMO_KEY
